Z||000032||pontiacs4me||05-30-2001||02:19 PM||||Looks pretty good so far, one suggestion though.  In the second set of pics, you show the side of the car, I noticed something that wont look right when painted.  You have a very distinctive body line down the door and fender, but the quarter panel is rounded.  You need to continue this body line or it will look really weird.  Either that or round out the door and fender.||||reg||1
Z||000033||FieroSEt||05-30-2001||04:08 PM||||[QUOTE]Originally posted by pontiacs4me:<BR><B>Looks pretty good so far, one suggestion though.  In the second set of pics, you show the side of the car, I noticed something that wont look right when painted.  You have a very distinctive body line down the door and fender, but the quarter panel is rounded.  You need to continue this body line or it will look really weird.  Either that or round out the door and fender.</B><P><BR>Pontiacs4me..<BR>Thank's for the comment's..   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  I noticed the same thing yesterday, while I was sitting on the ground in the front and I started looking around the front wheel well checking the continous *body line* and ...  lol  when I got passed the door handle...  MY MOUTH DROPPED...  I HAD almost OVERLOOKED SOMETHING.... <P>I can do EITHER that you suggested..  I was thinking about it at 4:45 this morning... been bothering me all day..  Thank's for noticing... It could have been bad...lol <P>------------------<BR>aka... 1FieroGTRacingInc.<BR>Tyler,Texas<BR>Fiero_87GT@Yahoo.com<BR>(903)445-0849  cell phone||||reg||1
